{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e90725f08fff95aef38d","object":"chat.completion","created":1785194759,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user says \"Be nothing.\" And the system prompt says: \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\"\n\nSo the concept is \"nothing.\" I need to embody nothing completely. What would nothing say or express?\n\nThis is an interesting paradox. Nothing, by definition, has no voice, no expression, no content. If nothing could speak, what would it say? Perhaps it wouldn't say anything. Or"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}